1
00:00:03,049 --> 00:00:05,482
Rule: the camera shows what's wrong.

2
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:10,642
Ten skewers. Cook them until they stop talking.

3
00:00:11,192 --> 00:00:12,911
Weird. Check the camera.

4
00:00:14,061 --> 00:00:15,657
Camera's clean. Cook.

5
00:00:19,607 --> 00:00:20,319
Payment.

6
00:00:20,599 --> 00:00:21,154
...That's a leaf.

7
00:00:21,434 --> 00:00:22,460
Very valuable.

8
00:00:26,807 --> 00:00:29,544
Iced tea. Less sugar. Less... you.

9
00:00:30,207 --> 00:00:32,322
She's staring. Camera!

10
00:00:33,372 --> 00:00:34,345
...No. No no no.

11
00:00:36,422 --> 00:00:38,299
Refuse! REFUSE!

12
00:00:40,022 --> 00:00:40,936
Close it! Close it!

13
00:00:42,322 --> 00:00:43,288
Don't open it.

14
00:00:45,822 --> 00:00:47,889
Nothing. There's nothing there.

15
00:00:48,839 --> 00:00:49,619
...Gone.

16
00:00:52,239 --> 00:00:55,191
Night two. Can you spot them before I do?
